package com.github.piotr_rusin.yule;
Reason: Changing the package declaration in the test class to match the underscore-based package naming convention (`piotr_rusin`) used by the main application aligns the test's package hierarchy with the application's actual structure. This allows Spring's component scanning mechanism to correctly traverse up the package hierarchy and locate the `@SpringBootApplication` configuration class, resolving the "No application configuration could be found" error.

